### negative number glued to its sign leaves two arguments
# shellcheck disable=SC2003
expr 5 -3
>>> SC2307 2:1

### output redirection swallows the operator
# shellcheck disable=SC2003
expr foo > bar
>>> SC2307 2:6

### pipe splits the expression
# shellcheck disable=SC2003
expr 1 | 2
>>> SC2307 2:6

### unquoted greater-equals parsed as a redirection
# shellcheck disable=SC2003
expr "x" >= "y"
>>> SC2307 2:1

### quoted positional parameters may split
# shellcheck disable=SC2003
expr "$@"
>>> none

### unquoted expansion may split
# shellcheck disable=SC2003
expr 5 $rest
>>> SC2086 2:8
